26500653787", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820441_951126503987120_4014824967113250940_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Agy0aEVT_TkQ7kNvwHZFyEY&_nc_oc=AdqDYf0xmSjoHs0_GnyxG4YX7OLbCKilbwIlP7XtH4LZsxNCVE1XpXplhuL1kUZFBGw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNvM172weSjfQjJwClthL1Xp8eri8PrTvuv2Ewa6GYkyQ&oe=6AE4973D"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "ss4.png", "id": "1345139984314349", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823802_1345139990981015_6376680688474809613_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rrJjteuM3WcQ7kNvwHwSMHH&_nc_oc=AdqdSe8bldZ0oiXxBkz91K1Sn4w4m4hfbUVYw36O8r6wlwtq9Xz_jvEozithhnfZqeU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQM7HKVoOHPAfsbGhfF9-nyjbRdzv3ygWTL3Hnt3uVDaJA&oe=6AE48E3F"}, "display_name": "Extreme Car Parking", "keywords": ["CarParking", "Car", "Driving", "Simulation", "Enjoy"], "long_description": "Extreme Car Parking is a challenging driving experience designed to test your precision, patience, and control behind the wheel.\n\nParking may sound simple, but in this game every level presents a new challenge. Tight corners, narrow paths, moving obstacles, and difficult parking spots will push your driving skills to the limit. You must carefully control your speed, steering, and positioning to successfully park your vehicle without hitting barriers or obstacles.\n\nEach stage requires focus and accurate movement. A small mistake can force you to restart the challenge, so every turn and adjustment must be handled with precision. As you progress through the levels, the difficulty increases with more complex layouts and tighter parking spaces.\n\nThe goal is not speed but control. Players must carefully maneuver their vehicles through challenging environments and reach the final parking spot perfectly. Mastering the balance between steering, braking, and positioning is the key to success.\n\nIf you enjoy realistic driving challenges and skill-based gameplay, Extreme Car Parking will put your abilities to the ultimate test. Stay calm, control your vehicle, and prove that you can master even the toughest parking situations.", "short_description": "Extreme Car Parking challenges your precision driving skills with tight spaces, sharp turns, and complex parking scenarios. Navigate through difficult obstacles, control your vehicle carefully, and park perfectly without crashing. Each level requires focus, patience, and accurate steering. Test your parking abilities and prove you can handle even the most extreme parking challenges."}]}, "developer_name": "Esti Soft", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1_l_GxTpD64zBNaY3TAnGXtCB1cmJE-E7/view", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Esti Soft", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.esti.tr/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "33508444395468059"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 3, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2104737897124298"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2039811733603628"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1828136871209596"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1828136871209596"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1787079600, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "21047378971